@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Ciclo Global de Seguridad: Autenticación JWT y Autorización Multi-Protocolo

actor "Usuario" as User

box "Frontend (Cliente SPA)" #E3F2FD
    participant "Vista de Autenticación\n(Host Application)" as LoginView
    participant "tokenService\n(LocalStorage)" as TokenStorage
end box

box "Backend: Aplicación Host" #FFF9C4
    participant "AuthController\n(Endpoint de Login)" as AuthAPI
    participant "AuthenticationManager\n(Spring Security)" as AuthManager
end box

box "Backend: Framework Toolkit (toolkit.*)" #F1F8E9
    participant "JwtUtils\n(Generación y Validación)" as JWTService
    participant "AuthTokenFilter\n(Intercepción REST)" as RESTFilter
    participant "Controladores Protegidos\n(BaseRestController)" as Controllers
end box

== 1. Autenticación Inicial y Emisión de Token ==

User -> LoginView: Introduce credenciales (username y password)
LoginView -> AuthAPI: POST /api/v1/auth/signin\n[Payload: LoginRequest { username, password }]
activate AuthAPI

AuthAPI -> AuthManager: authenticate(UsernamePasswordAuthenticationToken)
activate AuthManager
AuthManager --> AuthAPI: Authentication (UserDetails autenticado)
deactivate AuthManager

AuthAPI -> JWTService: generateJwtToken(authentication)
activate JWTService
JWTService --> AuthAPI: jwtString (Token firmado con HMAC-SHA256)
deactivate JWTService

AuthAPI --> LoginView: 200 OK [JwtResponse { token, id, username, roles }]
deactivate AuthAPI

LoginView -> TokenStorage: setLocalAccessToken(token)
LoginView -> User: Redirige a pantalla principal de la aplicación

== 2. Consumo de Endpoints REST Protegidos ==

User -> LoginView: Navega a sección protegida (ej. /users)
LoginView -> RESTFilter: GET /api/v1/users\n[Cabecera: Authorization: Bearer <token>]
activate RESTFilter

RESTFilter -> JWTService: validateJwtToken(token)
activate JWTService
JWTService --> RESTFilter: true
deactivate JWTService

RESTFilter -> JWTService: getUserNameFromJwtToken(token)
activate JWTService
JWTService --> RESTFilter: username
deactivate JWTService

RESTFilter -> RESTFilter: SecurityContextHolder.getContext().setAuthentication(auth)
RESTFilter -> Controllers: Continúa la cadena de filtros (FilterChain)
activate Controllers

Controllers --> LoginView: 200 OK [Datos protegidos serializados]
deactivate Controllers
deactivate RESTFilter

@enduml
